OL,3,GNEWSABeavers filmed bonding after
OL,4,Arelease in the wild
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists are hopeful that two
OL,7,Fbonding beavers who were released into
OL,8,Fthe wild earlier in 2026 could help to
OL,9,Fstrengthen the population of the
OL,10,Fcreatures.
OL,12,FThe beavers, which live on the
OL,13,FHolnicote Estate, Exmoor, Somerset,
OL,14,Fwere captured on trail cameras grooming
OL,15,Feach other.
OL,17,FThe semi-aquatic rodents were released
OL,18,Fin February as part of the National
OL,19,FTrust's work to restore rivers,
OL,20,Fwetlands and floodplains on the
OL,21,F5,000-hectare site.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
