OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSABeavers filmed bonding after
OL,4,Arelease in the wild
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Trust ranger Mathieu
OL,7,FBurtschell said: "The fact that they
OL,8,Fhave paired up is a good indication
OL,9,Fthat they have found the right
OL,10,Fconditions at Holnicote, with enough
OL,11,Fsuitable habitat, food and space to
OL,12,Festablish a territory together."
